{"Title":"An Act relative to electric vehicles","BillNumber":"H3797","DocketNumber":"HD3655","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"PKF1","Name":"Paul K. Frost","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PKF1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T12:10:00.73"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"PKF1","Name":"Paul K. Frost","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PKF1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T12:10:00.73"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3797/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Frost of Auburn, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 3797) of Paul K. Frost relative to electric vehicles and electric vehicle charging stations.  Telecommunications, Utilities and Energy.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Subsection (a) of section 81 of chapter 179 of the acts of 2022 is hereby amended by striking out the figure “2035,” and inserting in place thereof the following figure:- 2050.\r\n\tSECTION 2. Section 96 of said chapter 179 is hereby amended by striking out the figure “2035,” and inserting in place thereof the following figure:- 2050.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J37","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J37"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}